cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Leviate in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Leviate"
abstract: >-
  Move 3D models and the mouse with your bare hand, through any webcam or a phone.
  The hand is tracked on the device and the video never leaves it. Web app, desktop
  app for Windows, macOS and Linux, Chrome extension and Blender add-on.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Vladyslav"
    family-names: "Pereverzyev"
    website: "https://www.vladpereverzyev.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vladpereverzyev/leviate"
url: "https://vladpereverzyev.github.io/leviate/"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - hand tracking
  - gesture control
  - 3D viewer
  - webcam
  - accessibility
  - MediaPipe
